# TaxOS România — repository-root ignores.
# Each app under apps/** carries its own, more specific .gitignore; this
# file covers the docker topology layer and anything that could land at the
# repo root.

# Local secrets — never commit real credentials (BLUEPRINT.md §4.10).
# The installation's environment, which holds every credential: apps/api/.env — and any other `.env`
# someone adds. The repository root's own `.env` is the exception and is committed: it configures
# nothing, it only points compose at the file above.
.env
!/.env
.env.*.local

# Editor / OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Local scratch space some tools default to at the repo root.
/tmp/
docker/nginx/certs/*.key

# A stray sqlite database is created whenever DB_DATABASE names a file instead of a
# Postgres database — `apps/api/kern` appeared exactly that way during a test run.
# It is never the real database (that is Postgres, in a volume) and can hold real rows
# if someone points a dev command at it, so it must never be committed.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
/apps/api/kern
/apps/api/database/*.sqlite

# Debugging screenshots pasted in while working. The design mockups (kern-*.html) are
# deliberately kept — they are the reference the UI is built against.
*.PNG
*.png
!apps/api/public/icons/*.png
!docs/**/*.png

# Design mockups. Reference material, not part of the application.
/kern*.html
/apps/api/kern*.html
